              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Please choose a topic to get started:\n\n1 - Career and Lifecycle\nCovers confirmation, transfers, relocation, performance management, promotions, PIP, certification reimbursement, and other employee lifecycle policies.\n\n2 - Conduct and Compliance\nCovers Code of Conduct, Disciplinary Process, POSH, Whistleblower, Non-Retaliation, and Background Verification (BGV) policies.\n\n3 - IT and Security\nCovers IT security, password and data protection, asset management, VPN, device usage, remote access, and information security policies.\n\n4 - Compensation, Rewards & Travel\nCompensation, rewards and recognition, business travel, travel expenses, reimbursements, and allowances.\n\n5 - Onboarding and Culture\nOnboarding, induction, leave and holiday policies, workplace culture, employee engagement, and new-joiner policies.\n\nReply with the option name or number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1787088641075",
          "code": "IF_OUT_OF_SCOPE",
          "type": "CONDITION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "If Out Of Scope"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 7006,
            "y": 6237
          },
          "outcomes": {
